    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d361">

                <pb facs="0475" n="363" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg363"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Bogota</hi></placeName>
                        <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content-and-sibling-dates"
                            calendar="gregorian" notAfter="1909-02-14T23:59:59-05:00"
                            notBefore="1909-02-12T00:00:00-04:56">undated</date>)<lb/>(Received Feb.
                        14, 1909).</dateline></opener>
                <p>Arrived. National assembly summoned for February 22; prospects ratification
                    favorable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
